blocks.text:
Jo molecule genetic material ka kaam kare, us mein kuch khaas khoobiyan honi chahiyein, maslan:
• woh proteins mein amino acids ki tarteeb ka code de sake;
• cell division se pehle apni copy (replication) bana sake;
• eukaryotic cells ke nucleus mein maujood ho;
• waqt ke saath badal sake taa ke evolution (irtiqa) mumkin ho.
Sirf aik molecule, DNA, yeh saari sharaait poori karta hai.
